    "body": "You don't pass omit. It mirrors the `crossOrigin` IDL attribute/`crossorigin=\"\"` content attribute: missing (null) = omit, anonymous = same-origin, use-credentials = include.\n\nWe could use fetch()'s RequestCredentials enum, but I thought it'd be better to stick with the terms and API from HTML. WDYT?\n",
