    "body": "One advantage of the existing setup is that we can use null to mean different defaults if we extend CORS to classic workers (there null -> same-origin, for back-compat). I guess we could do that with the new scheme though too; we just use `RequestCredentials? credentials = null` and determine what `null` means based on classic vs. module.\n\nI'm happy to switch this to `RequestCredentials credentials = \"omit\"` for now if you think that's best for new APIs.\n",
