    "body": "This doesn't clearly tie them together other than through intuition that \"classic script\" is coupled with \"run a classic script\". It's also not entirely clear to me what \"it\" is referring to. Something like \"Run a classic script\" if /x/ is a \"classic\" script\", and \"run a module script\" otherwise.\" would be better I think.\n",
