      "user_view_type": "public",
      "site_admin": false
    },
    "body": "I have two thoughts here:\n1. It would be nicer if the method was simply not exposed.\n2. The way we designed this setup for service workers was that it could overwrite certain algorithms here. Should we not be overwriting the \"validate the state\" algorithm? I do think that would be less readable so perhaps it's simply a manner of the current setup not being ideal.\n",
